# Personal tooling stays out of the repository. A maintainer keeps theirs in a
# private checkout under .maintainer/ and links or writes it into these paths;
# skill installers write .agents and skills-lock.json. No trailing slash where
# the path may be a symlink: `dir/` does not match one.
.maintainer
.basic-memory/
.superpowers/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/agents
.claude/skills
.mcp.json
